    "tow": false,
    "group": [
      "pge:22364"
    ],
    "notes": "Large area to land at bottom mostly some rocks and larger rocks but mostly flat with some obvious gullies. An area has been cleared near the track before the junction at the bottom, or land in the D shape easily seen. In winter mostly Bedouins in the area as is warmer weather. So try to land away from livestock Goats Camels etc",
